#: ../../tools/metaboanalyst_tools.rst:63 51d489dfed0145f48c654c063560569a
msgid ""
"**Description**: List available KEGG metabolic pathways for a species "
"with compound counts. Returns all pathways with their IDs, names, "
"category (metabolic vs non-metabolic), and number of metabolites in each "
"pathway. Use for: browsing available pathway libraries before running "
"enrichment analysis, or identifying pathways relevant to a metabolomics "
"study."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/metaboanalyst_tools.rst:67 344ed6aa87994738b2030f917aeb355f
msgid ""
"``organism`` (string) (required) KEGG organism code. Default 'hsa' "
"(human). Common codes: hsa=human, mmu=mouse, rno=rat, dme=fly, sce=yeast,"
" eco=E.coli."
msgstr ""

