#: ../../tools/metaboanalyst_tools.rst:125 592d2669d43747aabf12e9eb02a0e32c
msgid ""
"**Description**: Perform metabolite pathway enrichment analysis (over-"
"representation analysis) using hypergeometric test. Maps metabolite names"
" to KEGG compound IDs, then tests which KEGG metabolic pathways are "
"statistically enriched for the input metabolites. Returns pathways ranked"
" by p-value with fold enrichment, FDR correction, and hit metabolites. "
"Use for: identifying dysregulated metabolic pathways from a list of "
"differentially abundant metabolites."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/metaboanalyst_tools.rst:129 ad05dc46002e4a51ba0e128c3a5cd846
msgid ""
"``metabolites`` (array) (required) List of metabolite names to test for "
"pathway enrichment. Example: ['glucose', 'pyruvate', 'lactate', "
"'alanine', 'glycine']"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/metaboanalyst_tools.rst:132 47d32825ca6d4ea7aad3e8c1d9051b5a
msgid ""
"``organism`` (string) (optional) KEGG organism code. Default 'hsa' "
